  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Had">Had.</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And to hádbote, gif liflire wurðe, toeacan þam rihtwere, þone forman stæpe bete man mid punde 7 mid godcundre bote þingige georne.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And in compensation for [an offence against a man in] orders, if loss of life occurs, one must pay for the first degree with a pound, in addition to the legal wergild, and intercede zealously with ecclesiastical penance.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">7 to hadbóte, gif liflyre wurþe, toeacan þam rihtwere, þene forman stæpe bete man mid ane punde 7 mid godre bote þingie georne.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">And as compensation for one in orders if loss of life occurs, one must make amends for the first rank with one pound in addition to the standard wergild, and he must diligently plead for proper reconciliation.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
